WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
Do electrons orbit the nucleus like planets round the sun?

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:08.280
That is an old, simplified picture. Today we draw a fuzzy cloud instead.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:14.016
Electrons are not tiny planets on tracks. We can only say where they are likely to be found.
